/-!
# DLMF §6.13: the polynomial identity behind 6.13.2

With `δ = t − 16t³/3 + 1673t⁵/15 − 507746t⁷/105` (`t = 1/α`), `E = 1 + tδ`, and the truncated
expansions of `f`, `g` (6.12.3, 6.12.4, four terms each) and of `sin δ`, `cos δ`, the residual
`f sin δ − g cos δ` at `x = α + δ` is `t^{10} zeroPolyR(t)/E⁸`: the coefficients of
`t⁰, …, t⁹` cancel, which is what pins down the coefficients of 6.13.2.
-/

